 equivalent and&nbsp;</span><br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> computer 3 class diploma or equivalent&nbsp;</span><br/> <br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> 3. We need people who has capacity of excellent knowledge of international trade&nbsp;</span><br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> in theory and in practice , plus who has the more interesting in logistics and&nbsp;</span><br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> trade practice, and who has a basic understanding of the actual international&nbsp;</span><br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> trading processes.&nbsp;</span><br/> <br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> 4. We need people who has ideals, perseverance, responsibility, self-discipline,&nbsp;</span><br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> and friendly.&nbsp;</span><br/> <br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> 5. We warmly walcome a large number of graduating students and young people in&nbsp;</span><br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> society who come here to candidates and to display their talent better.</span><br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> Requirement：</span><br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> 1. Company sincerely recruite many business managers from society (people of&nbsp;</span><br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> foreign nationality can apply for too).</span><br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> 2. We need people with educational background which is at least university&nbsp;</span><br/> <span style="font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;color:#009900;"> education, in particular, require a 4 English class diploma or eq